{"files":[{"content":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <cstdint>\n\n#if defined(__aarch64__) && defined(__ARM_NEON)\n#include <arm_neon.h>\n#endif\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst uint32_t MOD = 1000000007;\n\n#if defined(__aarch64__) && defined(__ARM_NEON)\nstatic inline uint32x4_t add_mod(uint32x4_t a, uint32x4_t b) {\n    uint32x4_t sum = vaddq_u32(a, b);\n    const uint32x4_t modulus = vdupq_n_u32(MOD);\n    return vsubq_u32(sum, vandq_u32(vcgeq_u32(sum, modulus), modulus));\n}\n#endif\n\nint main() {\n    int n, m;\n    cin >> n >> m;\n    vector<vector<int> > blocked(n);\n    for (int c = 0; c < m; ++c) {\n        int i, j;\n        cin >> i >> j;\n        blocked[i].push_back(j);\n    }\n\n    vector<uint32_t> dp(n, 0);\n    vector<uint32_t> open(n);\n    dp[0] = 1;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n        fill(open.begin(), open.end(), UINT32_MAX);\n        for (int j : blocked[i]) open[j] = 0;\n\n        uint32_t carry = 0;\n        int j = 0;\n#if defined(__aarch64__) && defined(__ARM_NEON)\n        const uint32x4_t zero = vdupq_n_u32(0);\n        const uint32x4_t ones = vdupq_n_u32(UINT32_MAX);\n        for (; j + 4 <= n; j += 4) {\n            uint32x4_t mask = vld1q_u32(open.data() + j);\n            uint32x4_t values = vandq_u32(vld1q_u32(dp.data() + j), mask);\n\n            // Segmented inclusive scan: a blocked cell resets the prefix.\n            uint32x4_t shifted = vextq_u32(zero, values, 3);\n            values = add_mod(values, vandq_u32(shifted, mask));\n            mask = vandq_u32(mask, vextq_u32(ones, mask, 3));\n\n            shifted = vextq_u32(zero, values, 2);\n            values = add_mod(values, vandq_u32(shifted, mask));\n            mask = vandq_u32(mask, vextq_u32(ones, mask, 2));\n\n            // Only lanes before the first blocked cell inherit the carry.\n            values = add_mod(values, vandq_u32(vdupq_n_u32(carry), mask));\n            vst1q_u32(dp.data() + j, values);\n            carry = vgetq_lane_u32(values, 3);\n        }\n#endif\n        for (; j < n; ++j) {\n            uint32_t value = dp[j] + carry;\n            if (value >= MOD) value -= MOD;\n            carry = open[j] ? value : 0;\n            dp[j] = carry;\n        }\n    }\n\n    cout << dp[n - 1] << endl;\n}\n","path":"src/solution.cpp"}],"hypothesis":"A four-lane ARM NEON segmented prefix scan can legally vectorize the horizontal DP dependency while preserving blocked-cell resets and exact modular arithmetic.","notes":"Each modular addition combines two reduced residues and fits uint32_t. Obstacles are stored by row, including harmless duplicates. A scalar fallback and scalar tail preserve arbitrary valid dimensions. Performance remains for the controller to evaluate.","research":{"queries":[],"urls":[]},"sources_kept":[],"transformations":["Replace the two-row DP and row copy with an in-place row and a horizontal carry.","Express four adjacent cells as a two-stage segmented SIMD prefix scan, propagating the incoming carry only through unblocked prefixes.","Store obstacle columns by row and materialize a reusable SIMD-friendly open-cell mask."]}